==German==

===Etymology===
{{term|zu||to|lang=de}} and a word related to {{term|same|lang=en}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|sem-||together, one|lang=ine-pro}}. Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|samen||together|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|sco|-}} {{term|samin||together|lang=sco}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tsuˈzamən/|lang=de}}
* {{hyphenation|zu|sam|men}}

===Adverb===
{{de-adv}}

# [[together]]

====Usage notes====
* {{context|chemistry|lang=de}} as an abbreviation, [[Z]], it is used to mean [[cis]] (see also [[entgegen]])

